<h3 style="color:#007aff;border-bottom:2px solid #007aff;padding-bottom:4px">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
<p><b>Q: Can I renew after the certificate expires?</b><br>
A: Yes, but your app will be removed from the App Store during the gap. Re-submission may take 1-3 days for App Review.</p>

<p><b>Q: Will existing users be affected?</b><br>
A: Installed apps continue working, but push notifications and in-app purchases will break.</p>

<p><b>Q: I don't have access to Xcode. Can I renew from a web browser?</b><br>
A: Yes, use Method 1 above (App Store Connect web renewal). The device verification flow works entirely in the browser.</p>

